        <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Class" xmi:id="_1agrUIuHEfGVwI18gr1osA" name="Redundancy">
          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="__G87cIuHEfGVwI18gr1osA">
            <body>3 sensors that can fall on each other &#xD;
if either one fails or gets spoofed</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="__G-woIuHEfGVwI18gr1osA">
            <body>&quot;totalSources&quot; = 3&#xD;
&quot;minimumVotes&quot; = 2&#xD;
One failed source: the remaining two sources &#xD;
(LiDAR and Radar for example) still satisfy minimumVotes, &#xD;
so VotingSystem still produces a trustworthy output.&#xD;
</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="__HAl0IuHEfGVwI18gr1osA">
            <body>Use of a dedicated Fusion Processor to prevent other &#xD;
variables of cryptography and processing timings &#xD;
affect evaluation of number of sensors</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <ownedAttribute xmi:type="uml:Property" xmi:id="__G54IIuHEfGVwI18gr1osA" name="Voting System" type="_SCymMHZGEfG_hu9eze5UeQ" aggregation="composite"/>
